Hi {Owner},

I build websites for med spas and injectables clinics around {City}. {Business Name} has thoughtful treatment posts on its social pages, but no site where a cautious first-time client can read who injects, how pricing works and what the consultation is like.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: treatments by concern, a supervision section with bracketed placeholders for your real credentials, unit and syringe pricing explained, and a consultation request that keeps health details off the form. It uses marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and treatment changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes after clinic hours?

